# The Vercel project's Root Directory is `website`; nothing else in this repo builds the site.
# Everything below is excluded so the uploader never walks the iOS tree — that tree is a MOVING
# target, and a deploy died mid-upload lstat-ing an XCBuildData file another session's build had
# already replaced (2026-08-29). Exclusions are listed rather than allow-listed: `/*` + `!website/`
# leaves Vercel unable to find its own root directory.
build
Momentum
Momentum.xcodeproj
MomentumTests
MomentumUITests
MomentumWatch
MomentumWatchWidgets
MomentumWidgets
docs
scripts
supabase
*.md
*.canvas
*.base
*.xcconfig
project.yml
